  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000pck3](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000pck3) Magnitude 5.4 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Feb 10 2025 25km E of Stirling Island. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -7.391 longitude 155.7971. It impacted 3125 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
